        "synopsis": {
            "value": "Kang Yong-Ho (Son Hyun-Joo) is the chairman of the Choiseong Group, which is a leading conglomerate in South Korea. He built the company by himself and he is now known as the God of Business. One day, he has an unexpected accident. He collides with a young man named Hwang Jun-Hyeon (Lee Jun-Young). Hwang Jun-Hyeon is a soccer player who has just joined League 1 team FC Choiseong. Due to the accident, Chairman Kang Yong-Ho's soul is swapped with soccer player Hwang Jun-Hyeon's soul.\n\nWith Chairman Kang Yong-Ho's soul in Hwang Jun-Hyeon's body, he applies to the Choiseong Group as a new employee. He starts his unpredictable journey with his soul as an outstanding businessman and the young body body of Hwang Jun-Hyeon.",
            "source": "asianwiki",
            "source_link": "https://asianwiki.com/Reborn_Rookie"
        },
